      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94475,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767107452866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you. Let me pull that up... Okay, I see the Aero Road Helmet, delivered six days ago. To make sure I process this correctly, what specifically is the issue with the item? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
