      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 94475,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767107468933332
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. Getting the right gear is key, especially when it comes to a crucial piece of safety equipment like your helmet. Not a problem at all. Since it was delivered last week, you're well within the 90-day return window.",
