      "user_id": 94475,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767107491933331
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I have just initiated the return authorization. I'm emailing you a prepaid shipping label right now. Just print it out, attach it to the box, and you can drop it off with the carrier. Once we receive the helmet, your full refund will be processed.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
